      mp3: 
      ms: 0
    female|a||Claxton and colleagues measured the NHS margin at about thirteen thousand; critics call the estimate fragile, extrapolating from mortality to quality of life — the authors answer that even a wide error band leaves NICE above the margin. Unresolved.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
    'female|a||Which leaves a modest obligation: if you set lambda above the margin, say out loud that you are buying less health, and say what you are buying instead — severity, rarity, a promise kept.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
    'female|a|grave|Across this series: the threshold is not what society says it will pay, it is what the next krone already buys — and everything approved above it is paid for by patients you will never meet.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 0
